    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu waenderera kuaambira anafundzie, “Nakuambirani kpweli, phapha phana anjina ambao taandafwa hadi auone ufalume wa Mlungu ukedza kpwa nguvu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chiyunani chinaamba,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kabila ya kuona ufalume wa Mlungu ukedza na uwezo mkpwulu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.1.17+2PE.1.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Petero 1:17–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya siku sita, Jesu wauka na Petero, Jakobo na Johana, achiambuka nao mwango mure ili akakale machiyao. Ariphokala hiko mwangoni, mwiri wa Jesu wagaluka mbere yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguwoze zangʼala sana zichikala nyereru hali ya kukala takuna mutu awezaye kuzifula dza hivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho hipho Elija na Musa achiatsembukira, achikala anabisha na Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Petero achimuamba, “Mwalimu, ni vinono swiswi kukala hipha. Phahi baha hudzenge vibanda vihahu. Chimwenga chako, cha phiri cha Musa, na cha hahu cha Elija.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero achikala kana ra kugomba mana iye na hara ayae atishirwa sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 3:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 1:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 3:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha phatserera ingu richiabwiningiza, na kuchituluka sauti kula himo inguni ichiamba, “Hiyu ni mwanangu nimmendzaye sana. Muogopheni!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho hipho hara anafundzi aphelephesa chila phatu, ela taonere mutu wanjina yeyesi ela Jesu macheye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakati kala anatserera kula mwangoni, Jesu waakahaza asimuambire mutu yeyesi mambo achigogaona, hadi iye, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, ndiphofufuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, agbwira lagizo hiro, ela achikala anadziuza, “Mana ya kufufuka nini?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Malaki 4:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.11.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 11:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimuuza, “Mbona alimu a Shariya anaamba ati ni lazima Elija edze kpwandza?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiamba, “Ni kpweli Elija ni lazima edze kpwandza atayarishe chila chitu. Hata hivyo kpwa utu wani yaandikpwa kukala ni lazima mimi, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, niteswe sana na kukahalwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nakuambirani kukala Elija wakpwedza kare, na nyo atu achimgbwayisa vira arivyolonda, dza maandiko gaambavyo kumuhusu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu na hara anafundzi ahahu ariphofika kura kala kuna anafundzi ayawao, aona kundi kulu ra atu hipho. Na alimu anjina a Shariya akala analumbana nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rira kundi ra atu ririphomuona Jesu, osi aangalala, chisha achimzorera kpwendamlamusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiauza, “Mnalumbana nao chisa nini?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu mmwenga kula mo kundini wamuamba, “Mwalimu, nkakurehera mwanangu barobaro, ana pepho yemuhenda bwibwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila achigbwirwa ni hiye pepho, nkumʼbwaga akatuluka fulo ra mromo, akasaga meno na kudina mwiri mzima. Nkaambira anafundzio amtuluze hiyu pepho ela akashindwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphosikira hivyo, waamba, “Mwi atu msiomkuluphira Mlungu! Ndakala namwi hadi rini? Nindakuvumirirani hadi rini? Hebu mreheni ye mwanache.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi amphirika yuya mwanache kpwa Jesu. Na phapho hipho pepho ariphomuona wamʼbwaga yuya mwanache na achimtiya chifwafwa. Yuya mwanache wagbwa achigalagala na achituluka fulo ra mromo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achimuuza ise wa yuya mwanache, “Mambo gano gamuandza rini?” Naye achiamba, “Hangu wanachewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara nyinji hiye pepho nkumʼbwaga mohoni au madzini ili amuolage. Phahi ichikala unaweza kuhenda chochosi, huonere mbazi na huuterye!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achiamba, “Hangbwe ichikala ninaweza! Chila chitu chinawezekana kpwa mutu aaminiye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phapho hipho yuya ise wa mwanache wakota kululu achiamba, “Naamini! Ela niterya niamini zaidi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
