            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu ariphoona kundi kulu ra atu rinaenjerezeka zaidi, wamdemurira yuya pepho, achiamba, “Uwe pepho yemuhenda bwibwi na masito hiyu mwanache, nakulagiza umtuluke na usimuuyire tsona!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hipho yuya pepho wakota kululu, achimʼbwaga yuya mwanache na achimuhenda afurukute sana alafu achimtuluka. Yuya mwanache achizimiya, hata anji aho achiamba, “Akafwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu achimgbwira mkpwono achimuunula, naye yuya mwanache achiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Jesu ariphoinjira nyumbani, anafundzie achimuuza wakati kala a machiyao, “Kpwa utu wani swino tahuwezere kumtuluza yuya pepho?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye achiamba, “Aina hino ya pepho taiweza kutuluka isiphokala kpwa kufunga na kuvoya bahi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu na anafundzie auka hipho, na ariphokala anaphiya, atsupira seemu za Galilaya. Jesu kayamendza atu amanye kura ariko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kpwa mana kala anafundza anafundzie. Wagomba achiamba, “Wakati ukafika mimi, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, niyalaviwa kpwa anadamu ambao andaniolaga. Ela siku ya hahu bada ya kuolagbwa, ndafufuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hara anafundzie taaelewere mana ya mambo higo, na achiogopha kumuuza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi aphiya Kaperinaumu. Na Jesu ariphokala akainjira nyumbani, waauza anafundzie, “Che munalumbana nani kura njirani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 22:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela nyo achinyamala, mana himo njirani kala analumbana kuhusu ndiyekala mkpwulu kahi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.20.26+MAT.20.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 20:26–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.43+MRK.10.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mariko 10:43–44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 22:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi bada ya Jesu kusagala, waiha hara anafundzi kumi na airi achiaambira, “Mutu achilonda kukala wa kpwandza ni lazima akale wa mwisho na akale mtumishi wa osi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha achigbwira mkpwono mwanache mdide, achimuimisa mbere zao. Achimuika chifuwani alafu achiaambira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 10:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 10:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.13.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 13:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mutu yeyesi ndiyemkaribisha mwanache dza hiyu kpwa sababu yangu, ananikaribisha mimi. Na kanikaribisha mimi bahi, ela anamkaribisha hiye ariyenihuma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Johana achimuamba, “Mwalimu, hwamuona mutu anahumira dzinaro kutuluza pepho, naswi huchimkahaza, kpwa kukala siye myawehu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jesu achiaambira, “Msimzuwiye, mana takuna awezaye kuhenda vilinje kpwa uwezo wangu, chisha phapho akagomba mai kunihusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 12:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 11:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mutu ambaye kahupinga, manyani ni myawehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 10:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu yeyesi ndiyekuphani chikombe cha madzi ga kunwa kpwa sababu mu atu a Masihi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:41",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chiyunani chinaamba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Masihi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ", yani mutu yetsambulwa ni Mlungu kuokola atu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nakuambirani kpweli andatuzwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu waenderera kugomba achiamba, “Shakare yeyesi ndiyehenda mmwenga wa hano adide anikuluphirao kuhenda dambi; mutu hiye baha afungbwe lala kulu singoni akatsuphiwe ndani ya bahari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 5:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mkpwonoo uchikuhenda uhende dambi, ukate. Mana ni baha uinjire uzima wa kare na kare na mkpwono mmwenga, kuriko kukala na mikonoyo miiri na utsuphiwe moho wa kare na kare usiozimika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:43",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vya kare vina misitari ya 44 na 46, ambayo ni sawa na msitari wa 48.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na chigulucho chichikuhenda uhende dambi, chikate. Mana ni baha uinjire uzima wa kare na kare na chigulu chimwenga, kuriko kukala na magulugo mairi chisha utsuphiwe kuzimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.5.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 5:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na dzitsoro richikuhenda uhende dambi, risokole! Ni baha kuinjira ufalume wa Mlungu na tsongo, kuriko kukala na matsogo mairi na utsuphiwe kuzimu. ",
          "type": "text",
